    """Deut 7:1-26 (cold_run_seven_nations.py F1-F6). given_at Deut 7:1 — THE BAN'S FIRST AND ONLY GIVING, the chapter's own line on the counter's
    day (40, 11, 1), NO marker; installed_by boot (the Deuteronomy daemons' form). THREE TAPE LINES of its own: nations_devoted (7:1-5 — the ban a
    DEBIT on Israel valued devote_the_seven_nations OPEN to Joshua; covenant_barred, favor_barred, intermarriage_barred three BLOCKS), hearing_blessed
    (7:12-16 — blessings_for_hearing a conditional HEAVEN entry; pity_barred a BLOCK) and abomination_barred (7:25-26 — house_abomination_barred a
    BLOCK). The exam's case kind dispatches to the cells in EXPLICIT branches with LITERAL effects per kind (an unnamed effect is a KeyError). No
    timer; no close; the second word's and the tenth word's blocks, the treasure's entry and the dispossession's debits UNMOVED (CQ5, CQ7)."""
